window.products.push({"id":1078153,"name":"Amscan 579592.40 Apple Red Flannel-Backed Table Cover, 54\" x 108\", 1ct","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.26,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwCpbJRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A best choice for all parties and events, Amscan vinyl table cloth is worth your time and money. Your party will never be the same with this table cover! Resilient fabric won't fade, rip or weather easily. On top of that, the design can create a joyful ambiance in any table.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DwCpbJRQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"amscan","source_asin":"B00BFX8LES","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078153","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BFX8LES","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BFX8LES","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078154,"name":"Consigli 6-1/3-Inch Blade Olive Wood Handle Cleaver Knife","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EtecBWbJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"For generations, the Consigli family has been leveraging its passion and expertise to produce high-quality traditional Tuscan pocketknives and cutlery, using the same forging techniques that the master knifemakers of Scarperia have been refining since the 14th century. The town of Scarperia was founded on September 8, 1306. Back in those days, the town was sited on what was then the most important road for anyone wishing to cross Italy. The production of cutting irons has also been crucial to the town�s development from the outset; this specialization was perhaps the result of local military requirements or possibly due to the needs of the local farmers. For more than two centuries, blades from Scarperia were renowned as being of unrivaled quality. In the second half of the 19th century that Scarperia�s knives and cutlery started to experience increasing demand. With the unification of Italy came numerous orders from all over the country, and particularly from the south. Because of this southern influence, the origins of several types of knives made in Scarperia (the Calabrese, the Napoletano and the Casertano) can be traced back to the south of Italy. As a result, the reputation for the quality of the knives made here has been consolidated once again, and they are now rightly celebrated throughout the world. The Old Family Tradition Fifty years have now passed since the time of the Fondo Pasinetti - the site in Via Magenta, in the center of Scarperia, where the Consigli brothers opened their first premises. Luigi - at the time, just a little over 20 years of age - and Enrico, his slightly younger brother, had already spent several years producing knives on behalf of the same company for which their father had been forging metal and making pattada knives and grafting knives since the very early part of the century. Currently, alongside its typically Italian models, which represent the perfect synthesis of tradition, technique, elegance, and refinement, the company also produces high-quality table and kitchen cutlery that is expertly finished using noble materials like cow horn, buffalo horn and olive wood. The Consigli family is totally committed to authentic steel-working techniques and to the preservation of the values of manual processing. The Comet: A Symbol of History When holding a Consigli knife, it is easy - for the expert and the layperson alike - to appreciate the clean lines, the painstaking finish and the warmth of the natural materials. Opening and closing the blade, one comes to realize the precision and fluidity of the mechanism, and, on closer inspection, one makes out the almost imperceptible imperfections that highlight the authentic, hand-crafted nature of the knife. One's eye is drawn to the signature, (the pride of every true artisan), to the guarantee of reliability and to the symbol with which the Consigli brothers like to adorn their creations. Along with the sun, the comet is the astronomical symbol par excellence. It was used time and again in ancient graffiti and on coins, and was rediscovered centuries later by renaissance cutlers. Indeed, in accordance with the Statute of 1630, since that time all knifemakers in Scarperia have had to use their own version of the comet symbol. Consigli's comet has undergone a natural evolution over the decades. The latest redesign, dating from 2004, evokes luminosity and dynamism, appearing like an imaginary bridge between the drive to conserve traditional ideals and the drive towards the future. How a Knife is Made A perfect knife is the result not only of skilled workmanship but also of the care taken in selecting the very best raw materials. For this reason, the Consigli family invests considerable time and effort into searching out the finest horn available, and rigorous criteria are applied to ensure that the horn selected has all of the features that, throughout the centuries, only experienced cutlers have been able to identify. The wood used by Consigli is carefully selected and then seasoned for years, in order to guarantee its stability and workability. The steel used for the blades is of the highest quality, and has undergone exacting thermal treatments at the hands of a master craftsman to create the perfect synthesis between elasticity and durability. From the outset, the Consigli brothers have always supervised the end-to-end production process of their knives and cutlery. The steel components - blade, springs, etc. - are made by punching dies that (more often than not) have been produced by the same artisans who go on to make the knives themselves. The main pieces of the knife are stamped out of solid steel before undergoing the extremely delicate processes of tempering and quenching. These processes enhance the attractiveness of the knife and are an opportunity for the artisan to express his or her mastery of the art of knifemaking. Even today, the time-honored technique of allowing the knife to drop to the ground and listening to ","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41EtecBWbJL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CONSIGLI","source_asin":"B0055WKRC4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078154","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0055WKRC4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0055WKRC4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078155,"name":"GenRev Reptile Plant Vines Terrarium Habitat Décor Set with Suction Cups for Bearded Dragon, Anole, Gecko, Lizard, or Snake Cages – Includes Food Wate","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lCGpAidaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Functional… Suction cups make the plants quick to install on a clean GLASS surface at any safe height in your terrarium or vivarium habitat. Provides smaller reptiles an interactive surface to crawl on in order to access better basking angles or reach other climbing structures in the habitat. The plant vines add diverse surfaces, angles and heights in the habitat to keep your pet occupied, feeling secure and comfortable to minimize stress. This set also includes a shallow dish that allows pets big and small access to food, water or treats. Versatile… The plant vines can be installed at different heights and configurations to provide new and interesting environments and options for your pet to explore and enjoy. Comfortable… The leaves are flexible and soft to give your pet a pleasant surface to comfortably rest, bask, or hide. Cleaning Advice… Simply wipe your plant vines with a damp cloth as needed – soaking or submerging the leaves may affect the leaf color patterns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lCGpAidaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GenRev","source_asin":"B07VZ85F52","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078155","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VZ85F52","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VZ85F52","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
