window.products.push({"id":1078183,"name":"Melodieux Linen Ombre Semi Sheer Curtains 96 Inches Long for Living Room, Orange White Horizontal Gradient Grommet Voile Drapes, 52 x 96 Inch, 2 Panel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jinbPkIeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Set of 2: Sold as pair per package, each package includes 2 panels orange ombre semi sheer curtain drapes, 52\"Wx96\"L per panel (2 Panels total width 104\"). Length measures from the top hem to the bottom. Linen Textured: Premium faux linen fabric with a soft and silky cotton blended texture, curtains made with exquisite workmanship. Upgraded print technique makes the color gradients clear and durable, tones vary naturally from light to dark. Gradient Fashion: Chic orange to white horizontal gradient design, catch your eyes at first sight. Semi sheer ombre curtains decorate your windows with rich color tones, just get inspired from natural sunset and sunrise, curtains hangs like the dawn and dusk sky. Privacy Protected: 8 Silver metal grommets per panel, 1.6 inch inner diameter, versatile for most standard curtain rods, can be hung separately, or arrange in pairs with blackout curtains in Melodieux. Fabric 30-40% light blocking, smartly invites some light to your room, while still not see through from outside, breezy and cozy. Easy Care: Machine washable in cool water, do not bleach, tumble dry low. Wrinkles will disappear after hanging for a few weeks, or iron at low temperature setting. We are dedicated to your shopping experience, any issues and questions just feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jinbPkIeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melodieux","source_asin":"B0915G5L1S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078183","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0915G5L1S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0915G5L1S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
