window.products.push({"id":1078242,"name":"800 Thread-Count 100% Cotton 3 Piece Bed Sheet Set, Best fit Twin XL Sateen Sheets, Breathable, Soft & Silky, Wrinkle Free, Low Pill, Quick Dry, Paten","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516Gs2N60rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Material: 100% Extra-long Staple Cotton - Infinity Sateen Weave. Imported from Leedv23 Silver Certified Factory in India. Imported from LEEDv4 Silver Certified Factory in India DIMENSION: Twin XL Extra-long Staple Cotton 3pc Bed Sheets Set : 1 Flat Sheet: 66\" W x 102\" L; 1 Fully Elasticized all around Fitted Sheet: 39\" W x 80\" L + 16\" finished deep pocket to fit mattresses from 9\" to 18\"; and 1 Standard Pillowcases: 20\" W x 30\" L. Our Deep Pocket fitted sheet feature Smart Head/Foot Tag to indicate the width side of the bottom fitted sheet for ease of use. Machine wash, Do not bleach, Do not dry clean, Tumble dry normal, Iron medium, Dry in shade. FEATURES: Sink into unbelievable comfort with our 800 Thread Count Sheet Set. Crafted out of the finest long staple fibres, experience the soft hand feel of these 100% cotton sheets. Soft and silky for extended comfort. This sheet set is resistant wrinkle and shrink and pills low. Fabrics made of long-staple cottons. The longer the cotton fibre, the stronger, softer, finer and more durable is the fabric. These sheets last for a longer duration; even after several washes. PERFECT FIT NO POP OUTS: Addressing your needs for easy to use and snug fitting sheets, our team has created the True Grip fit technology to provide a perfect fit solution for your bed. These fitted sheets fit mattress height ranging from 7 to 18 inches. Our patented technology for fitted sheet provides 1” wide boxer elastic on the edges of fitted sheet along with ½” elastic on drop of the sheets to provide a snug fit. This ensures your sheets stays in place with varying depths of mattress. NOTHING BUT THE BEST CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE: In our quest to deliver a better sleep experience through outstanding bedding, we use the best equipment from around the world in our state-of-the-art facilities. Furthermore, our skilled and experienced employees are in control of the entire process including product development and design, sourcing of cotton, spinning, weaving, processing, cut-n-sew, and branding under one roof to have complete control of the quality in each tailor made sheet set. CARE INSTRUCTION: Machine wash, Do not bleach, Do not dry clean, Tumble dry normal, Iron medium, Dry in shade.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/516Gs2N60rL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Neo Fresh","source_asin":"B07NWTZVY1","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078242","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NWTZVY1","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NWTZVY1","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
