window.products.push({"id":1078296,"name":"N/C Nakiri Knife 6.5 inch Professional Chef Knives Nakiri Vegetable Knife, Multipurpose Kitchen Knife with Ergonomic Blue Resin Wood Handle and Gift B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710iu7QfHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Yi-A Brand You Can Trust: Yi is a professional brand specialized in the production of high end Kitchen Knife products. We are Professional Chefs Knife widely recognized and trusted by users, can meet different kind of customers needs and satisfactory experience. All of chef knives products comply with international quality standard and are greatly appreciated in a variety of different markets all over the world. Product information: Product Name:XF008S-JN 6.5-inch Nakiri Knife Total Length: 11.5 inch Blade Length: 6.5 inch Handle Length: 5 inch Blade Thickness: 2.2 mm Package Include: 1 x 6.5 Damascus Nakiri Knife 1 x Upscale Gift Box About Materials: Hardness: 60±2 HRC Handle Material: Blue resin wood Blade Material: Damacus High Carbon Stainless Steel Weight Blade Texture:Hammer Texture, elegant and delicate Total Weight: 438 g Net Weight: 242 g Warm Tips: 1.NOT to use the chef knife cut bones or hard food (bones, dried food, frozen food, shelled nut etc.). Frozen food have to be full thawed before cutting. 2.PLEASE NOTED: The logo of the vegetable knife is engraved on the blade surface by laser technology, so it's color may be a little different from the blade, but it's NOT rusty. 3.NOT to touch corrosive, hydrochloric acid kind materials, keep away from fire, NOT soak or clean with saline water. Washing and drying the chef's knife after use immediately. NOT using the dishwasher. 4.To ensure a beter performance, please select different types kitchen knives for cutting different food. 5.If the Damascus Cleaver Knife is blunt,using professional sharpening stone. NOT to use rough sharpening stone or rod, that will be damage the steel core and the beauty of the texture. 6.PLEASE NOTED: All dimensons are measured manully, the devistion within 1-2 mm.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710iu7QfHbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"N\\C","source_asin":"B08X249X69","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X249X69","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X249X69","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
