window.products.push({"id":1078413,"name":"Amyove TV Stand for 65+ Inch TV, Industrial Entertainment Center TV Media Console Table, Farmhouse TV Stand with Storage, Mesh Door and Shelves, Gray ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wdXEjQbXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"INDUSTRIAL TV STAND: This entertainment center is adorned with metal stylistic elements, an easy-to-match rustic color and a high level of perfection in the details to boast a classic industrial design, making this industrial tv stand not only elegant and beautiful but also highly practical. The wood tv console table can perfectly match any style of room decor and is perfect for a farmhouse, living room, bedroom, or as storage cabinet in the kitchen PRODUCT DIMENSIONS: The industrial TV stand overall size is 63” L x 18.3” W x 25” H. It is suitable for flat screen and curved TVs up to 70 inches. The clean-lined and scientific and rational layout ensures ample storage space. The Industrial entertainment center gives you ample storage space for media players, game consoles, photo frames, plants, books, tv components, and any other home decor art to keep your living room clean and away from sundries. HIGH-QUALITY MATERIAL: The TV stand is made of upgraded high-density MDF board and sturdy metal, which is more sturdy and durable. The TV stand adds an iron crossbar in the middle, the thickened table top provides excellent stability and durability, the wood tv stands top can hold up to 500 lbs and the shelves can hold up to 30 lbs, enough for your needs. Excellent craftsmanship make this living room TV stand sturdy which is no afraid of long time use. CHIC ENTERTAINMENT CENTER: The Entertainment center adopts a visual mesh door designed to allow you to hide or reveal this home entertainment center freely, and flexibly divide it into different storage and display area. Designed with cable holes on the back of the farmhouse TV console table to store extra cables, this TV stand cleverly hides clutter, big or small. There is 10 inches of space between each tier, allowing you to place bulky items. EASY ASSEMBLY: This industrial tv console table has been checked and well-packed before shipping. You don't need to worry about assembly, the farmhouse tv stand comes with detailed installation instructions, parts and accessories are labeled with numbers, and precise holes make installation accurate and fast. 1-2 people can assemble in about 1-2 hours. If you have any questions before or after your purchase, you can always email us, and we always reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61wdXEjQbXL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Amyove","source_asin":"B0BRFNQ838","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078413","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRFNQ838","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRFNQ838","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
