window.products.push({"id":1078471,"name":"BOSALY Milk frother, Electric Milk Frother, Automatic Milk Steamer, Milk Foamer Frother, Milk Steamer Warmer Frother Heater for Lattes, Coffee Espress","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617HCeE15nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ 【GET THE BEST CREAM & MILK FOAM IN SECONDS】: The gospel for foam milk and coffee lovers. BOSALY Electric Milk Steamer provides the best frothy milk for making coffee, latte, hot Chocolates, Cappuccino. It only takes 80-90 seconds to quickly heats milk to 60℃ (140℉), making your milk rich and creamy. ★【STYLISH DESIGN AND EASY TO CLEAN】: BOSALY Milk frother is stylishly designed, adding a sleek and modern look to your kitchen. Non-stick coating jug offers you a no hassle cleaning. Premium High quality milk frother guarantees the smooth texture and best flavor foamy milk for your latte cappuccino. ★【MULTIPLE-FUNCTION】: BOSALY Milk Steamer included 2 different whisks (frothing whisk and heating whisk), 3 different settings let you addicted to café-style coffee drinks with different textures of froth (Hot Froth, Hot Milk, Cold Froth). Meet your different taste requirements for cold or hot milk foam. ★【SIMPLE AND CONVENIENT OPERATION】: With the simple touch of a button, you can taste smooth milk foam every time. There are automatic shut-off function and can hold up to 300ml of milk for heating or 150ml of milk for frothing. Milk level indicator inside, which is convenient for pouring the right milk every time. Enjoying your morning coffee like never before. ★【HAPPY SHOPPING】: Provide the highest quality and reliable products, maximize convenience of milk foam coffee lovers, this product will live up to your expectations. If any questions, you can contact us at any time, we will do our best to support you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617HCeE15nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BOSALY","source_asin":"B082VFRPWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078471","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082VFRPWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082VFRPWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078472,"name":"Cornhusker Kitchen Gourmet Duck Fat Spray Cooking Oil - All-Natural Spray Oil - Non Stick Cooking, Baking Butter Spray, Grill Oil Spray - 3 Packs, 7oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FZAYvA4IL._SL1000_.jpg","description":"Size:3 How to use Gourmet Duck Fat Spray Use Duck Fat Spray as a non-stick coating vs. those other name brands that are getting some bad press for all the additives they include. (Our spray has none of those nasties.) Lightly spray Duck Fat Spray directly onto your pan or baking dish before cooking/baking. We also recommend applying Duck Fat Spray atop your food to give baked goods this amazingly flaky outer shell, vegetables a versatile coat, and more. Now your herbs and spices will stick to your food for a livelier meal. If you’ve ever shaken your can of Duck Fat Spray and heard a thud, don’t be alarmed. Inside a can of Duck Fat Spray, there’s a bag of duck fat surrounded by clean compressed air. When you shake it and hear a thud, that’s just the bag of duck fat moving inside of the can. What to do if my Gourmet Duck Fat Spray stop spraying Is your spray nozzle clogged? Unfortunately, this can happen from time to time. If your spray stopped working, try this: remove spray tip and run under very hot water, rinsing from the bottom side OR place spray tip in a cup of very hot water. Before replacing the spray tip, place the end of the straw in a cup of water to test the spray. If need be, repeat the process above. How to store Gourmet Duck Fat Spray? We strongly recommend storing Gourmet Duck Fat Spray in your pantry or countertop to keep the spray nozzle clear. Duck Fat Spray can be conveniently stored between 65-90 F. What makes Gourmet Duck Fat Spray reusable and recyclable? Gourmet Duck Fat Spray is reusable because of its high smoke point. It’s harder for breakdown to occur, so duck fat can be used again if you like. However, because you use so little with each spray, it’s unlikely you will need to. What makes our USA manufactured product recyclable is that we use a recycled, biodegradable can. We like that and know you do, too.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51FZAYvA4IL._SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cornhusker Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BTD359B4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BTD359B4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BTD359B4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
