window.products.push({"id":1078547,"name":"Silicone Suction Lids Airtight Seal Set, Easy to Apply and Remove Food Covers - Microwave/Oven Safe, Easy Food Storage, Splatter Protection, 6 sizes (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615adGYt+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multiple Functions: Use as a microwave splatter cover or over a saucepan on the stove. It lets steam out but keeps splatter in. Cover your bowls and keep nasty bugs away when eating outside. Cover your drink so nothing falls inside. Throw a silicone lid on leftovers, push down for an airtight seal and then just put in the fridge. 100% Food Grade: Plastics contain a very dangerous chemical called Bisphenol A (BPA), which has been linked to hormonal disruption, obesity, early puberty, as well as breast and prostate cancers. Our silicone suction lids is made of 100% food grade silicone, 100% non-toxic, BPA Free, protects you from toxins. Extra Large 14 Inch Lid: This set 6 lids: a 4inch, 6 inch, 8 inch, 10 inch, 12 inch and a giant 14 inch. The 6 inch is perfect for coffee mugs, cans and wine glasses. The 12 inch lets you cover your largest pots and bowls. Have a 12 or 13 inch pan? Try the 14 inch lid. And the 8 and 10 inch sizes are great for mason jars, cereal bowls, mixing bowls and more. ECO Friendly and Reusable: Eliminate plastic wrap from your kitchen, and use silicone suction lids instead. Reusable super suction food covers would serve you better. No odor, seals but clean up easily, even when cleaned in the dishwasher. What You Get: 6 x Silicone Suction Lids, a 4inch, 6 inch, 8 inch, 10 inch, 12 inch and a giant 14 inch. Our good custmer service ensure pleasant shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/615adGYt+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YUKSY","source_asin":"B06ZZJDNYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078547","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06ZZJDNYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06ZZJDNYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078548,"name":"Erinice Replacement Base Pre-Motor Filters for Shark AI Robot Vacuum AV2501S AV2501AE RV2502AE AV2511AE RV2520AOUS AV2510AOUS RV2610WA UR2500SR Parts,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51svOXHd3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% COMPATIBLE WITH】 The Replacement Parts are compatible with Shark AI Robot Vacuum AV2501AE, AV2501S, AV2511AE, RV2502AE, RV2502AECA, UR0200SR, UR2500SRCA, RV2300, RV2300S, RV2310, RV2310AE, AV2310, AV2310AE, RV2320S, UR2350AE, replace to part #XBPFRV2500. Please double confirm your robot model before purchase, to avoid wrong order! 【WASHABLE & REUSABLE]】 The vacuum base pre-motor filter replacement for Shark AI Robot AV2501AE is washable and reusable, just wash it by hand with warm water regularly, and let it completely air dry out before reusing them, in order to make longer lifespan and better filtration effect.It is recommend to wash the av2501s replacement parts once a month, and replace the av2511ae filter every 2-3 months to maintain peak performance and extend the life of your ai robot vacuum cleaner. 【PREMIUM QUALITY】 Our rv2502ae replacement filter for Shark AI robot is made of premium foam felt material to keep the vacuum cleaner's suction. Our ur2500sr filter part can capture 99.7% of contaminants and impurities before it damages your motor and prevent them being released directly back into the air flow. It can help capture dust particles, dirt, food scraps and pet dander while cleaning different surfaces,which has greatly improved the suction performance of shark vacuum model av2501s. 【EASY TO ASSEMBLE】Our AV2502AE replacement filter is 100% compatible with the original vacuum cleaner, and the replaceable dirt filter can be easily installed on compatible vacuum cleaner without other tool.The vacuum filters are inside the dirt-tank. just remove the dirt-bin by firmly grasping it and pulling it out, to empty the dirt-bin, find the release latch and pull it to open and empty. Take out the old av2511ae filter and then place the new RV2520AOUS replacement filter back into the bin. 【VALUE PACKAGE FILTER SET】Filter for Shark AI Robot RV2502AE vacuum cleaner spare parts Includes 4 pre-motor foam & 4 felt filter and 1 cleaning brush. Erinice av2510aous replacement filter set are with high quality and durability, so you get the high performance filter for shark ai robot av2501s vacuum cleaner. These XBPFRV2500 replacement filters are perfect for keeping your home clean and creating a relaxing and healthy living environment for your family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51svOXHd3xL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erinice","source_asin":"B0C6LVLXYJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078548","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6LVLXYJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6LVLXYJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
