window.products.push({"id":1078699,"name":"LORDTEX Blackout Curtains for Bedroom -Thermal Insulated Curtains with Grommet Top Room Darkening Noise Reducing Window Drapes for Living Room, 2 Pane","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aGfXS8CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% Polyester WHAT'S IN THE PACKAGE? Each set includes 2 dark gray blackout curtain panels, and each window drape measures 52-inch width by 84-inch length. 8 elegant silver metal grommets with 1.6-inch inner diameter, fit well with standard or decorative curtain rods, which makes the curtains easy to install and slide. PREMIUM BLACKOUT MATERIAL: Our room darkening curtain is made of 100% polyester fabric and have the same color of the front and back. Crafted in a certified STANDARD 100 by OEKO‑TEX factory from a durable soft and thick triple weave blackout fabric which block out 90% above sunlight and UV rays. Darker colors work better. ENERGY EFFCIENT AND THERMAL INSULATED CURTAINS: Bedroom curtains not only protect your furniture and floor exposed to the sun, but also balance your room temperature. Which insulate summer heat and winter cold, act as natural temperature regulator and help save on energy bills. NOISE REDUCING AND PRIVACY PROTECTING DRAPES: Light blocking curtains are thick and heavy. Which can help reduce outside noise for bedroom and living room, and also can be used as a partition to block the view of the room and create a private space for you. Quiet and dark environment make you will have a good sleep, full of energy and happiness every day. CARE IS SIMPLE: These black out curtains are machine washable and not easily deformed. You can wash with cold water and do not bleach. Iron on low heat if required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aGfXS8CIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LORDTEX","source_asin":"B083JZ383L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083JZ383L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083JZ383L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
