window.products.push({"id":1078742,"name":"FASHION in THE CITY 3D DIY Wall Clock Creative Design Mirror Surface Wall Decorative Sticker Watches (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gLRQhBihL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"1.Stickers Made of EVA Foam Material and Mirror Material, Which is Non Toxic and Non Fading, Can Last for About 3-5 Years. 2.Stickers Can be Removable ,With Glue on The Backside, Easy to Paste on The Wall or Any Other Clean and Smooth Surface; Such As Door ,the closet and so on 3.The mirror with glue, before to paste the sticker on the wall, you need to paste the mirror on the sticker surface first 4. DIY design, clock layout size measured by hands, can be adjust to be smaller or bigger size this is a 3D DIY wall clock,very nice one,high quality one. Sticker Material: EVA Foam (Ethylene vinyl acetate) Clock Material: Metal Hour Hand: 27.5cm Minute Hand: 33.5cm Clock Machine: 10cm Battery:1.5V AA battery 1 piece(without) The round pattern size:80CM-120CM The clock final decoration size is decided by how you want to decorate you walls. Choose color:Black Silver Gold Red (Has Mirror Acrylic Pieces) Packing: 1x Clock stickers 1x Clock mechanism Without battery How to Install? STEP1:Fasten the clock movement on the wall STEP2:peel off protection film from mirror,stick it on the EVA number.Cover the clock movement with the auxiliary scale,stick the numbers at the right site according to the scale. STEP3:Take down the clock movement,fixing the hour hand ,then minute hand.Tips:press the clock hands into the clock axle and point at 12 o'clock. STEP4:Adjust the time by button on the clock movement and install the battery. STEP5:Hanging the clock movement on the wall. STEP6:Well done!You can enjoy your art-work now(No retail packaging)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gLRQhBihL._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FASHION in THE CITY","source_asin":"B0894D2FT4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078742","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894D2FT4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894D2FT4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078743,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Evening Sun Dinnerware Set (32-Piece)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5149XGGMEYL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Serve delicious meals to family and guests in style with the Pfaltzgraff Evening Sun Dinnerware Set. This casual 32-piece dinnerware set with Southwestern accents is perfect for everyday dining. The set includes 8 each of the following: an 11-3/4-inch dinner plate, a 9-inch salad plate, a 24-ounce soup/cereal bowl and a 16-ounce mug. This Pfaltzgraff dinnerware set is made from durable earthenware which is chip-resistant. This set features fiery sunflowers on a sandy, speckled background. This dinnerware set is safe for the microwave, freezer, and dishwasher. Amazon.com Inspired by sunflowers glowing in the fiery rays of sunset, Evening Sun sets a warm, welcoming table. The oversized pieces show a sandy, speckled background, with sage-green leaves and sunflowers of every shade of yellow, orange, and red. On the dinner plate, the flowers fill the border; on the salad plate, a single, large bloom boldly nods off-center. This set amply meets most everyday needs by including eight of each of the following: 11-3/4-inch dinner plate, 9-inch salad plate, 24-ounce soup/cereal bowl, and 16-ounce mug. For a Southwestern feel, Evening Sun may be mixed with Pfaltzgraff's Nuance pattern, whose pieces, also speckled, come in sage green, chili red, and saffron yellow, and with Evening Sun coolers, which add sparkle and a splash of icy color. A wide range of Evening Sun platters and serving dishes quickly contribute to a party atmosphere. Made of durable earthenware, the set is safe for the microwave, freezer, and dishwasher. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 8 place settings. Each place setting consists of: dinner plate; salad plate; soup bowl; mug. 32 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5149XGGMEYL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B000H6W4L0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H6W4L0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H6W4L0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078744,"name":"Home-X Plastic Sub Container, Food Storage for Lunch Box/Meal Prep, BPA Free-Hero, Hoagie-11 L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MQPVuDhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD-GRADE MEAL PREP TRAYS: These plastic sandwich containers are a mindful choice for you and your kids. While many varieties of plasticware available may allow harmful chemicals to leach into your food, our meal trays are BPA-free and contain no toxins. You can have peace of mind using this convenient and safe box for all your meal planning. REUSABLE PLASTICWARE: Using this reusable kitchenware over plastic bags and other disposable products will lessen your impact on the environment. Eliminate waste by continuing to use these eco-friendly containers and feel good about your choices. They’re suitable for your child’s packed school lunch as well as your own lunch for work. SEALS IN FRESHNESS: When you have leftovers, don’t let them go to waste. Store them in this sealed container to lock in freshness. The easy snap-on lids will keep your food fresh until you’re ready to eat it, whether it’s a vegetable salad, a hoagie, fresh-cut fruit, or dinner from the night before. This container stores both hot food and cold food as well as dry goods and saucy entrees. SAFE FOR DISHWASHER & MICROWAVE: These bread-shaped containers offer the convenience that we all love and search out; they’re safe to put in the dishwasher for easy cleaning and to use in the microwave for fast reheating. This saves you the time and energy of cleaning the dish by hand and transferring the food to a stovetop pan for reheating purposes. PROTECTS INTEGRITY OF FOOD: This product acts as a protective hard case for your meals. If you have a sub for lunch, the plastic shell will prevent it from getting smashed in a backpack. These small lunch accessories are a must-have for those who carry bags filled to capacity each day. Kids will especially appreciate the fun sandwich shape and clear color that allows them to see their food.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MQPVuDhqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B07RG9XD4P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07RG9XD4P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07RG9XD4P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
