window.products.push({"id":1078755,"name":"Temmel Proofing Basket - 9 Inches Bread Proofing Basket Including Dough Scraper, Bread Lame, Brush and Linen Liner Cloth - Sourdough Starter Kit for H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pzrB-FNHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bread Banneton Proofing Basket: Temmel bread proofing box has been professionally handcrafted using the high quality natural rattan can. Healthy and material craft are perfect for use in the Home, Kitchen, Bakeries, Coffee Shop, Restaurant, or as a bread pastry storage bag, jar, crock. Every baker enjoys making best bread, it will attract many people to have a look and buy healthy delicious food, bringing much fun and make profits. Every baker starts with a proofing basket for sourdough and ends with a beautiful Sharpe of bread. Sourdough Bread Kit Packing List: 1 x Bread Proofing Basket (9inch) 1 x Bread Lame 1 x Dough Scraper 1 x Linen Liner Cloth Professional Baker's Choice: Banneton proofing box stick less, breathable, wicker make moisture away from the surface to make a crispier round crust. You can get multiple benefits while using our dough proofing box. It comes up with multiple features: 100 Percent safe, natural splinter-free rattan cane Traditional spiral ring pattern Moisture-wicking effect leaves your dough perfect for baking Perfect for both professional & home use Suitable for hundreds of great recipes. How It Works: Temmel bread basket proofing round made up of nice rattan rings. It transforms your bread in a unique piece of art with provided patterns. Fill the basket with plenty of flour. In the last stage of rising, place the dough in the Temmel basket until it doubles its size; After the dough has risen, gently transfer it from the basket to a baking product for oven. No more wait ! Click ADD TO CART and enjoy our versatile 9 inch proofing basket Kit !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61pzrB-FNHS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Temmel","source_asin":"B08GYDWRT3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078755","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GYDWRT3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GYDWRT3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1078756,"name":"nestl Reading Pillow, Includes 1 Extra Large Bed Rest Pillow with Arms + 2 Detachable Pillows - Premium Shredded Memory Foam TV Pillow, Neck Roll & Lu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614R8A7kjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EXPERIENCE ULTIMATE RELAXATION: Don’t settle for anything less than the best! The Nestl Reading Pillow is unlike any back pillow you’ve tried before. Larger than other reading pillows, sturdy and fully supportive, our bed backrest with arms is 31 inches high and will support and cradle your entire body, enveloping you with cozy warmth while you read in bed or watch TV! Sit back and prepare for the best relaxation experience of your life! IRRESISTIBLE COMFORT & LUXURY: Covered with a plush, luxurious, oh so soft cover and filled with premium, high density, shredded memory foam that contours to your body for the perfect amount of support, our bed rest pillow will embrace you like a warm hug and keep you from slouching while using your laptop in bed or playing video games on the floor! Easily carry the reading pillow to another room with the convenient carrying handle so you never have to compromise on comfort. BONUS POCKETS & DETACHABLE PILLOWS: Two convenient pockets help you create a cozy nest so that you don’t have to get up once you’ve finally gotten really comfortable! The small side pocket is handy for storing a remote, phone, while the larger back pocket is the perfect size for keeping extra magazines, books or a tablet. Two detachable pillows on bungee cords secure with elastic bands and large. Use the additional pillows for extra lumbar support, or even on your lap as a book rest! CUSTOMIZE YOUR EXPERIENCE: Choose from 12 vibrant colors! Our velvety soft pillow covers are removable and machine washable so you can relax with a hot tea or coffee without worrying about spills and stains! We recommend purchasing additional covers so you can keep using your pillow while the cover is being washed, or to match to the décor in different rooms. A zipper on the inner shell of the reading pillow allows you to remove or shift around the foam clusters for truly individualized comfort. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Welcome to the Nestl Bedding family! The Nestl Reading Pillow includes a 3-year limited warranty. In addition, every Nestl purchase includes a 100% money-back satisfaction guarantee! Our #1 goal is to provide you with unparalleled customer service, and we’re only happy if our customers are happy. Shop with confidence because no matter what, we’ve got you covered!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614R8A7kjUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nestl","source_asin":"B07VYL3PX9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078756","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VYL3PX9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VYL3PX9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
