window.products.push({"id":1078769,"name":"CROWNFUL Automatic Bread Machine, 2LB Programmable Bread Maker with Nonstick Pan and 12 Presets, 1 Hour Keep Warm Set, 2 Loaf Sizes, 3 Crust Colors, R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cefv03DkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍞12 PRE-PROGRAMMED MENU: This bread machine offers various course settings to choose from which includes: Basic, Gluten-Free, French Whole Wheat, Quick Bread, Sweet Bread, Dough, Cake, Sandwich, Butter Milk Bread, Kneading and Bake – even pizza dough. Plus, it has an audible reminder for adding fruits and nuts. 🍰 VERSATILE AND LARGE CAPACITY: The CROWNFUL Automatic Bread Machine Maker features a 3-color crust setting: light, medium and dark crust. It has 2 loaf capacity of 1.5 and 2.0 lb. The five-layer stretch bread pan makes the bread evenly baked. It’s non-stick pan so it’s easy to clean. ⏰13H DELAY TIMER & 1H KEEP WARM: The delay timer is an important feature which allows you to load your machine with ingredients and set it to start baking before you wake up in the morning. You can set it up to 13 hours in advance with 60 minutes keep warm function. Also, it has a built-in 10-minute power interruption recovery to ensure fresh bread anytime. CROWNFUL bread machine offers healthy, freshly, easy and tasty baked bread at home. 💟 EASY TO USE & ACCESSORIES INCLUDED: Designed with LCD intuitive digital panel for easy operation and a large transparent window for easy viewing. It comes with the accessories you need: 1 x Bread Hook, 1 x Measuring Cup, 1 x Measuring Spoon and 1 x Recipe Book. Have fun making a variety of healthy and fresh breads whenever! 💌 1-YEAR WARRANTY & LIFETIME SUPPORT: It comes with a 1-Year Warranty for all parts and accessories and lifetime support from CROWNFUL. Customer Satisfaction is Our TOP priority; Feel free to contact us if you have any concerns or questions about the product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71cefv03DkS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CROWNFUL","source_asin":"B089CYBJ65","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078769","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089CYBJ65","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089CYBJ65","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
