window.products.push({"id":1078884,"name":"Cooling Memory Foam Pillow for Sleeping Ventilated Gel Pillow for Neck Support Orthopedic Contour Pillow for Back, Stomach, Side Sleepers Soft and Fir","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DLWw9EhNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💓【Alleviate Common Sleeping Ailments】: To designed the best pillows for sleeping, we invited 2,036 testers(including back, stomach, and side sleepers) over the past years. Most of them described that the bed pillow is not only soft as clouds, but also has perfect supportive, wouldn't be flattened and keep its shape after long-term use. The firm pillow can give enough support to your heat, neck, ease shoulder, back and neck pain, reduce snoring and the number of flips while sleeping. 💓【Cooling Memory Foam Pillow】: To create a gel pillow, we adopted a honeycomb decompression hole design and the newly developed active foam, which can exhaust heat and circulate the air to achieve ventilation. The thermal characteristics of the cooling pillow and the specially added cooling gel particles can be adjusted according to the user's body temperature, cooling down, and keeping a comfortable sleep. 💓【Comfort Height】: The foam pillow won't be too flat or too thick, but comfortable mid-loft design, so it fits the golden ratio of the structure of the human body, can quickly match your personal appropriate height within 7 days due to the medium density and memory foam with slow rebound. The contour pillow is well designed to provide a cushion for the head and comfort or support for the upper spinal region while keeping the body in a horizontal position. Pillow size is 23.6*15.7*4.7 INCH. 💓【Healthy for You】: The foam is CertiPUR-US certified, it is not chemically treated and hypoallergenic. The pillowcase is specially woven with carbon-like fiber technology, it can effectively remove the harmful substance and keep it clean. The pillowcase is machine washable and tumble dry, do not clean the pillow inner. The bed pillow for sleeping will always feel and look like a new! (The unpacked fresh new odor will dissipate within 24 hours from when the foam is unpacked and aired out.) 💓【BEST GIFTS FOR FATHERS DAY 】 100% satisfaction guarantee, 2-year warranty, the most worry-free after-sales service, no need to return, you can get free replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DLWw9EhNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Royal Choice","source_asin":"B08LHHNH64","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1078884","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08LHHNH64","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08LHHNH64","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
